    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Standing on approx. half an acre of beautifully mature and private grounds, this exceptional detached residence extends to approx. 3,200sq.ft. and is presented to an outstanding standard throughout. Ideally positioned just 7km north of Tralee and on the southern edge of Abbeydorney village, the property enjoys the perfect balance of peaceful countryside living with excellent convenience to nearby amenities, schools and commuter routes.\r\nDesigned with modern family living I mind, the accommodation is both spacious and versatile, comprising four generously proportioned bedrooms and five luxurious bathrooms, all finished with impeccable attention to detail.  The interiors are bright, elegant and thoughtfully laid out, offering an abundance of living and entertaining space, together with high quality finishes and premium fittings throughout.\r\nExternally, the mature landscaped grounds provide exceptional privacy and ample space for family enjoyment, outdoor entertaining and recreation.  This is a rare opportunity to acquire a substantial turnkey family home in one of North Kerry’s most desirable residential settings."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Porch - 2.4m x 1.6m \r\nPorcelain floor, vaulted ceiling, tongue and groove\r\n\r\nHall - 5.6m x 2.4m \r\nPorcelain floor\r\n\r\nLiving Room - 5.0m x 4.3m \r\nOpen fireplace, carpet floor covering\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining - 7.25m x 5.9m \r\nFitted kitchen, island unit, granite worktop, tiled floor recessed lights\r\n\r\nWalk-in-pantry - 1.95m x 1.7m \r\nFitted shelving\r\n\r\nUtility - 3.6m x 3.0m \r\nFitted kitchen, eye and ground level units, tile floor\r\n\r\nGuest WC - 2.0m x 1.1m \r\nTile floor\r\n\r\nLounge - 5.2m x 4.3m \r\nVaulted ceiling, feature rafter ceiling, tongue and groove ceiling, tiled floor\r\n\r\nBathroom - 4.3m x 2.9m \r\nWC,WHB, corner bath and shower, tile floor and surrounds\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 5.1m x 4.1m \r\nSolid timber floor\r\n\r\nEnsuite - 2.0m x 2.3m \r\nWC, WHB, shower, tile floor & surrounds\r\n\r\nWalk in Wardrobe - 2.0m x 1.9m \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 4.7m x 3.6m \r\nSolid timber floor\r\n\r\nEnsuite - 2.4m x 1.3m \r\nWC, WHB and shower, tile floor and surrounds\r\n\r\nLanding - 6.45m x 3.0m \r\nLarge landing with solid timber floor\r\n\r\nBathroom - 3.4m x 2.5m \r\nWC, WHB and bath, tile floor\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 4.85m x 4.5m \r\nSolid timber floor, storage\r\n\r\nBedroom 4 - 6.45m x 3.85m \r\nSolid timber floor\r\n\r\nEnsuite - 3.1m x 1.85m \r\nWC, WHB and shower, tiled floor and surrounds\r\n\r\nWalk  in Wardrobe - 3.1m x 1.5m \r\n\r\n\r\nStorage - 4.8m x 1.5m \r\n\r\n\r\nGarage - 4.6m x 7.7m \r\n\r\n\r\n"
